MCP server
The Playwright Model Context Protocol (MCP) server is a powerful solution for automating Browser and API testing using Playwright.

//playwright Agents
Playwright comes with three Playwright Test Agents out of the box: 1) planner, 2) generator and 3) healer.
1) planner explores the app and produces a Markdown test plan
2) generator transforms the Markdown plan into the Playwright Test files
3) healer executes the test suite and automatically repairs failing tests